{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31884","headline":"别徐明府 · 贾岛","name":"别徐明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"抱琴非本意，生事偶相萦。\n口尚袁安节，身无子贱名。\n地寒春雪盛，山浅夕风轻。\n百战余荒野，千夫渐耦耕。\n一杯宜独夜，孤客恋交情。\n明日疲骖去，萧条过古城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31884.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31884","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}